OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785431952
OL,3,CThree hospitalised and animal seized
OL,4,Cfollowing suspected dog attack
OL,6,FThree people have been taken to
OL,7,Fhospital following a suspected dog
OL,8,Fattack.
OL,10,FEmergency services were called to a
OL,11,Fhouse in Barrie Way, in Bolton,
OL,12,Fshortly before 3:30pm on Wednesday, 29
OL,13,FJuly, following reports of a dog bite.
OL,15,FAn air ambulance landed nearby at Hall
OL,16,Fi' Th' Wood Museum as paramedics,
OL,17,Fpolice dog units, and armed officers
OL,18,Frushed to the residential street.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G1/3
