OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785431952
OL,3,CThree hospitalised and animal seized
OL,4,Cfollowing suspected dog attack
OL,6,FArmed officers were seen entering the
OL,7,Fproperty alongside a specialist dog
OL,8,Fhandler, who subsequently removed the
OL,9,Fanimal from the address and secured it
OL,10,Finside an animal transport van.
OL,12,FThe animal has been seized by police,
OL,13,Fthough its breed has not yet been
OL,14,Fconfirmed.
OL,16,FThe condition of the three victims has
OL,17,Fnot yet been released by police and no
OL,18,Farrests have been made so far and
OL,19,Fenquiries into the incident remain
OL,20,Fongoing.
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G2/3
