OL,0,        ECIMSBWebfax 1   F366A1785431952
OL,3,CThree hospitalised and animal seized
OL,4,Cfollowing suspected dog attack
OL,6,FA spokesperson for Greater Manchester
OL,7,FPolice said: "Officers were called
OL,8,Fjust before 3.30pm on Wednesday 29
OL,9,FJuly 2026 to a report of a dog bite at
OL,10,Fan address on Barrie Way in Bolton.
OL,12,F"Emergency services attended and three
OL,13,Fpeople have been taken by ambulance to
OL,14,Fhospital. One dog has been seized. No
OL,15,Farrests have been made and enquiries
OL,16,Fare ongoing."
OL,1,W~k4j5 hw1~k4~c1 hw}h7}j7}      G3/3
